@Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5078

### 会员档案样板
GET {{Api_HostAddress}}/api/members/1
Accept: application/json

### H · 订单列表（员工全部）
GET {{Api_HostAddress}}/api/paymentorders
Accept: application/json

### H · 会员订单
GET {{Api_HostAddress}}/api/paymentorders?memberId=1
Accept: application/json

### H · 优惠券
GET {{Api_HostAddress}}/api/vouchers?memberId=1
Accept: application/json

### H · 确认支付（待支付 → 已支付）
POST {{Api_HostAddress}}/api/paymentorders/2/pay
Accept: application/json

### H · 下单（自动选最优券）
POST {{Api_HostAddress}}/api/paymentorders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "memberId": 1,
  "totalAmount": 199
}

### H · 可用优惠券
GET {{Api_HostAddress}}/api/vouchers/available?memberId=1
Accept: application/json

### H · 改券
PUT {{Api_HostAddress}}/api/paymentorders/1/voucher
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "voucherId": null
}

### H · 取消订单（已支付退实付不退券）
POST {{Api_HostAddress}}/api/paymentorders/1/cancel
Accept: application/json

###
